ource or owner nextaction and safe deferral, not just vaguewarning. Do not insist on fullperformancegrid for unsupportedclaims that safely defer.\nVerify actual baseline protected file hashes (previous sources\/accepted docs\/evidence unchanged), current three docs hashes, copied SQL archive manifest and underlying cited numeric facts from resultsJSON. New final docs may combine official standard SQL semantics and established validated methods, but cannot claim new measurement, universal10%\/few%bound, N-only safe-primaryscan threshold, zero schema locks, zeroextraCPU or globalfastest. Do not import MySQL row-nonlocking into SQLdefaultlockingRC. Approximate smallness\/uncertifiedsample0 never productionfullCOUNT permission. Unsupported native performance\/100M80or100colTDEcross\/AlwaysEncrypted\/RLSruntime\/etc remain limited, not fabricated.\nChallenge practical operator steps: approvedexistingexportfirst; budgets beforemetadataSQL; metadata0\/NULL\/uninitialized\/absent\/denied\/errors unknown; no assumption allmetadata iscacheonly; reference vs empiricalcalibration vs exactsnapshot\/freshness. Row\/index width\/cache\/optimizerstats vs counters must be distinct. No automaticANALYZE\/UPDATESTATS\/indexcreation\/cacheflush, EXPLAINANALYZE or productionRCSI migration. TABLES vsPARTITIONS andSQLbaseindex0\/1\/allpartitions avoiddoublecounts. RLS\/tenant\/applogic\/softdeletes\/temporalcurrent-history\/views\/shards all definewhatrowsmean. MySQLnonInnoDB andtemp objects cannotinherit InnoDB COUNT assumptions. Normal SQLdiskcolumnstore should get a viable qualified standardCOUNT_BIG route without certifying unmeasureddelete\/delta performance; memoryoptimized\/external\/remote\/synonym require scopeappropriateowner path.\nFor exact: resourceisolation\/caps BEFOREmonitoring; existingreplicas\/backups provisioning itselfbudgeted; primarycurrentvsreplicasnapshot\/GTIDLSN andcross-tabletimesnotexactglobalcurrent. MySQLRC\/RRplainCOUNT row-nonlockingbutMDL\/undo remain; SQL